 Plan: TypeScript Model Builder Library

 Context

 Team lead trazi kreiranje standalone TypeScript funkcije (library) koja replicira Angular dinamicku komponentu logiku za popunjavanje db.model i db.output. Trenutno se ovaj
  proces desava unutar Angular-a kroz rekurzivne ContentLoader komponente, ValueManager, ApiCallParse, ApiDispatcher servise. Cilj je izdvojiti ovu logiku u cistu async
 TypeScript funkciju bez Angular zavisnosti, koja prima offerId, specId, processId + customer parametre, poziva backend API-je, i vraca popunjen model i output.

 ---
 Arhitektura

 Input

 {
   offerId: string;          // "5919"
   specId: string;           // "979"
   processId: string;        // "10"
   backendBaseUrl: string;   // "http://localhost:8080"
   customerParams: {         // P_CA_ID, P_BA_ID, P_SA_ID, etc.
     P_CA_ID?: string;
     P_BA_ID?: string;
     P_SA_ID?: string;
     [key: string]: any;
   };
 }

 Output

 {
   model: Record<string, any>;   // Hijerarhijski popunjen model
   output: Record<string, any>;  // Metadata struktura
   errors: Array<{ element: string; error: string; phase: string }>;
 }

