 Implementacija po fajlovima

 1. types.ts - Interfejsi

 Kopirati iz src/app/z-dynamic/interfaces/data.value.interface.ts:
 - InputObject (sva polja)
 - InputValue (defaultValue, generationFormula, lookupStatement, data, autoincrement)
 - DynamicOutput (attr, items, spec, name, code, value, active, calss, ...)
 - InputValidation
