 Dodati:
 - BuildModelInput (input za glavnu funkciju)
 - BuildModelResult (output)
 - ErrorEntry (element, error, phase)

 2. http-client.ts - HTTP wrapper

 Zamjenjuje RestApiService + ApiDispatcher:
 - get(path, params?) - native fetch GET, vraca response.payload
 - post(path, body) - native fetch POST sa entity wrapping ({ languageId: 0, channel: '', entity: data }), vraca response.payload
 - Detektuje HTTP metod iz path-a: POST@/path -> POST, /path -> GET (default)

 3. api-call-parse.ts - Parsiranje SQL-a i API poziva

 Port iz: src/app/z-dynamic/services/apicall.parse.service.ts

 Kljucne metode:
 - parse(value, model, param, statement?) - Entry point
 - parseToUseStatement(value, model, params) - Zamjena #:FIELD# -> vrijednost iz params, $:FIELD -> vrijednost iz model-a
 - parseToUse(value, model, params) - Parse API method poziva
 - getElementParamVal(params, paramName) - Traverse parent() chain za nalazenje parametra
 - mapvalue(obj, key) - Case-insensitive property lookup
 - find(value, model, params) - Nadi vrijednost po markeru

 4. auto-increment.ts - Counter

 Port iz: src/app/z-dynamic/services/auto.increment.service.ts

 Jednostavan counter: set(name, value), increment(name) -> vraca sekvencijalni broj

 5. value-resolver.ts - Popunjavanje modela (KLJUCNI FAJL)

 Async port iz: src/app/z-dynamic/services/value.manager.ts

 Glavna razlika: sve subscribe() callback-e zamjenjujemo sa await.

 async set(el, model, parameters, mod = 'new'):
   1. Ako el.externalAPI -> await setChildren(el, model, parameters)
   2. Ako el.externalMessages -> await setmessages(el, model, parameters)
   3. Ako template je radio/select ILI model[el.name] === undefined:
      a. autoincrement(el, model, parameters) ||
      b. setValueByRefOrCode(el, model, parameters) ||
      c. setDefaultValue(el, model)
      d. Ako el.value.generationFormula -> await dblookup/generate()
      e. Ako el.value.lookupStatement -> await dblookup/generate()

 Kljucne async metode:
 - dblookup() - POST /uomback/common/lookupStatement sa parsiranim SQL-om
 - generate() - Dinamicki API poziv parsiran iz formule
 - setChildren() - Dohvata child strukturu iz externalAPI
 - setmessages() - Dohvata validation poruke

 Sync metode (direktan port):
 - setDefaultValue() - model[name] = el.value.defaultValue
 - setValueByRefOrCode() - Resolve mappingRef (external., head., sum:, anc.)
 - autoincrement() - Auto-numberiranje
 - setvalue() - Processira API response i assigna u model
 - isValueValid() - Validira da li vrijednost postoji u opcijama
 - mappingreference() / mappingreffbyor() - Resolve reference putanje

 6. output-builder.ts - Kreiranje output strukture

 Port iz: src/app/z-dynamic/services/model.service.ts -> setoutput() metoda

 function setOutput(el, model, output, index):
   el.output = output[index] = output[index]
     ? Object.assign(output[index], { name, code, value: !el.export || model })
     : { attr: {}, items: {}, spec: {}, name, code, value, active, calss, businessParams, label, elementType, dataReference }

 7. structure-processor.ts - Rekurzivno procesiranje (KLJUCNI FAJL)

 Zamjenjuje ContentLoader + DefaultBlock + BasicBlock rekurziju.

 KRITICNO - Model je HIJERARHIJSKI, ne flat!

 Oba bloka (basic_block i default_block) u ngOnInit rade:
 if (!this.model[this.items.name]) this.model[this.items.name] = {};
 I oba template-a prosljedjuju model[items.name] djeci.

 async processElement(item, model, output, parameters, parent?, pname?):
   1. Date validacija (validFrom/validTo)
   2. item.active = item.active ?? true
   3. Linkovati parametre: item.parameters.parent = () => parameters
   4. await valueResolver.set(item, model, item.parameters, mode)
   5. index = getIndexName(parent, pname, item, model)
   6. setOutput(item, model, output, index)
   7. Kreirati nested model: model[item.name] = model[item.name] || {}
   8. childModel = model[item.name]
   9. outputTarget = output[index] || output
   10. Procesirati sub-nizove SEKVENCIJALNO:
       - for (input of item.inputs)    await processElement(input, childModel, outputTarget.attr || outputTarget, ...)
       - for (element of item.elements) await processElement(element, childModel, outputTarget.items || outputTarget, ...)
       - for (child of item.children)   await processElement(child, childModel, outputTarget.spec || outputTarget, ...)
       - for (action of item.actions)   await processElement(action, childModel, {}, ...)
       - for (message of item.messages) await processElement(message, childModel, {}, ...)

 8. index.ts - Glavna funkcija

 export async function buildModel(input: BuildModelInput): Promise<BuildModelResult> {
   const httpClient = new HttpClient(input.backendBaseUrl);
   const errors = [];

   // 1. Fetch structure
   const response = await httpClient.get('/pcrt/order-entry', {
     interactionId: 16,
     productOfferId: input.offerId,
     productSpecificationId: input.specId,
     appProcessId: input.processId
   });

   // 2. Initialize model i output
   const model = { auto: {} };
   const output = {};

   // 3. Merge params
   const params = { ...response.parameters, ...input.customerParams, P_MAIN_OFFER_ID: input.offerId };

   // 4. Init servise
   const apiParse = new ApiCallParse();
   const autoInc = new AutoIncrement(model);
   const valueResolver = new ValueResolver(httpClient, apiParse, autoInc, model, params, errors);
   const processor = new StructureProcessor(valueResolver, errors);

   // 5. Procesirati strukturu rekurzivno
   await processor.processStructure(response.structure, model, output, params);

   // 6. Cleanup (ukloni parent() reference za serialization)
   const cleanModel = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(model));
   const cleanOutput = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(output));

   return { model: cleanModel, output: cleanOutput, errors, structure: response };
 }

